{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc37 Welcome to the wonderful world of &quot;Piggy Only Up&quot;! \ud83d\udc37</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is a climbing feast waiting for you to join~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/e0a6b248273fb4194441da5ecc94c8e6.avif?t=1755028360\" width=600 height=329 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to embark on a journey alone and challenge yourself in exciting levels; You can also call friends and support up to 8 pigs online fun adventures! Imagine: fighting side by side with a group of cute pig friends, sprinting to the top of the world, has that scene already made your heart flutter? \ud83d\udc93</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc3d The level designs are full of surprises ! \ud83d\udc3d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/cf3f20a432b1f65889ba7fe67a6a691b.poster.avif?t=1755028360\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/cf3f20a432b1f65889ba7fe67a6a691b.webm?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/cf3f20a432b1f65889ba7fe67a6a691b.mp4?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >trampolines \ud83d\udecf\ufe0f, cannons \ud83d\udca5, rockets \ud83d\ude80 and other elements may bring you unexpected assistance or tests at any time, and every step is full of unknown and fun!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc16 The interactions between pigs are even more wonderful !\u00a0 \ud83d\udc16</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/500c6881e1b843d5b8f2504746468c35.poster.avif?t=1755028360\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/500c6881e1b843d5b8f2504746468c35.webm?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/500c6881e1b843d5b8f2504746468c35.mp4?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc50 Want to collaborate? No problem! You can push other pigs up and move them with you; It can also be cleverly stacked, making it easy to jump to higher places and break through obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/25b3dbb9c98938b1dd40da646c0ef8de.poster.avif?t=1755028360\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/25b3dbb9c98938b1dd40da646c0ef8de.webm?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/25b3dbb9c98938b1dd40da646c0ef8de.mp4?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude1c But if you want to be naughty, you can also choose to obstruct your companions: with a light bump, you can knock the other pigs away and stage a joyful &quot;skirmish&quot;~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/3a783369e22fe5022093fea2b01f80e0.poster.avif?t=1755028360\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/3a783369e22fe5022093fea2b01f80e0.webm?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/3a783369e22fe5022093fea2b01f80e0.mp4?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f\u00a0But be warned: both player-controlled Pigs and NPC Pigs will deal damage. Once your HP reaches 0, you'll regret leaving, but don't worry \u2013 you'll start over at the last record point and continue your climb!\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc57Dress up the piggy !\ud83d\udc57</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/b13915d430a6a3eea3b52127f1ec6f58.poster.avif?t=1755028360\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/b13915d430a6a3eea3b52127f1ec6f58.webm?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/b13915d430a6a3eea3b52127f1ec6f58.mp4?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc51What's even more interesting is: you can dress up your pig to your heart's content and make it the coolest piggy in the team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc16 Find the lost pigs ! \ud83d\udc16</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/a6a087dedfb71ac8094fc7d92fb5ae23.poster.avif?t=1755028360\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/a6a087dedfb71ac8094fc7d92fb5ae23.webm?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/extras/a6a087dedfb71ac8094fc7d92fb5ae23.mp4?t=1755028360\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4bOn the way to climb, you may also encounter lost pigs and lend a helping hand, and there may be unexpected surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc37It's a journey full of challenges and joys ! \ud83d\udc37</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warmth of collaboration, the excitement of competition, and the sense of accomplishment of breaking through yourself. Here, every climb is a new story, and the protagonists of this story are you - a group of brave and cute pigs! Ready to embark on this amazing adventure? Rush! \ud83d\ude80 Climb the peak together, defy setbacks, showing your skills and perseverance. It will be the best trip. This is your story.\ud83c\udf81</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3865250?t=1755028360","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/4ba995fe0b46fbe8d196f4dc9a6150bc60cdbb6b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755028360","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/5457aa31c7771fce76a4664192cda1446bd21353/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755028360","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/5457aa31c7771fce76a4664192cda1446bd21353/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755028360","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc37 Welcome to the wonderful world of &quot;Piggy Only Up&quot;! \ud83d\udc37</h2><p class=\"bb_paragrap