</video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc4bOn the way to climb, you may also encounter lost pigs and lend a helping hand, and there may be unexpected surprises!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc37It's a journey full of challenges and joys ! \ud83d\udc37</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The warmth of collaboration, the excitement of competition, and the sense of accomplishment of breaking through yourself. Here, every climb is a new story, and the protagonists of this story are you - a group of brave and cute pigs! Ready to embark on this amazing adventure? Rush! \ud83d\ude80 Climb the peak together, defy setbacks, showing your skills and perseverance. It will be the best trip. This is your story.\ud83c\udf81</p>","developers":["AoiHoshizora"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865250/68bbf8a64215e445a49fb1dadb80cc2733fc4cd1/header.jpg?t=1755028360","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 AoiHoshizora.All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3865250/1435254920/8bd2e6e3cf417a83df7b153a5e040ec303f1ea65/1754592273/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754595348","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3865250/1435254920/8bd2e6e3cf417a83df7b153a5e040ec303f1ea65/1754592273/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754595348","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3865250/1435254920/8bd2e6e3cf417a83df7b153a5e040ec303f1ea65/